This repository includes vendor/switch-agent-runtime, copied with small changes (test files left out) from
https://github.com/sandbox-quantum/switch, console/packages/switch-agent-runtime, commit 7e18c5e
(runtime 0.8.0). The changes, all in src/event-stream.ts and marked "[Context Keeper change]": a
`startPosition` option, so a restarted agent resumes every room from where it stopped; and an
`onAlive` callback (every frame, ping and landed heartbeat), the socket's close code and reason in
the disconnect message, and the caller's signal closing the open socket, so the agent's stream
watchdog can tell a quiet connection from a live one and replace it.
